sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant UI as Manager / Game Launcher
    participant RH as Runtime Host
    participant MT as ModeTransition
    participant MP as ModePolicy
    participant BP as Blocker Providers
    participant Repo as Machine Repository
    participant Broker as Privileged Broker
    participant Ctx as Context Owners / Windows

    User->>UI: Request target mode
    UI->>RH: RequestModeOperation
    RH->>MT: validate request
    MT->>Repo: Acquire major mutation lease
    Repo-->>MT: lease + fence token
    MT->>Repo: Create durable operation
    MT->>BP: Inspect current context
    BP-->>MT: blockers / evidence

    alt user decision required
        MT-->>UI: blocker decision request
        User->>UI: choose closed option
        UI->>MT: SubmitBlockerDecision
        MT->>BP: Resolve / recheck
        BP-->>MT: resolved evidence
    end

    MT->>MP: Resolve immutable target policy
    MP-->>MT: policyId/version/digest
    MT->>Ctx: Build typed action plan
    MT->>Repo: Persist plan

    loop ordered actions
        MT->>Ctx: Apply user-session action
        opt privileged action
            Ctx->>Broker: allowlisted capability + fence
            Broker-->>Ctx: technical result
        end
        Ctx-->>MT: immediate result
        MT->>Repo: advance action journal
    end

    MT->>Ctx: Read actual target state
    Ctx-->>MT: verification evidence
    MT->>Repo: persist mandatory verification

    alt target verified
        MT->>Repo: Atomic CommitTransitionAndMode
        Repo-->>MT: COMMITTED
        MT-->>UI: committed target presentation
        MT->>Repo: Mark COMPLETED + release lease
    else target not verified
        MT->>Ctx: rollback/reconcile source or BASE
        Ctx-->>MT: rollback evidence
        MT->>Repo: terminal result or Recovery escalation
    end
